  "Map": "地图",
  "Advanced": "高级",
  "Local operation": "本地运行",
  "With \"Email + 2FA Code\" Roborock sends a six digit code by email. There is no input field for it here: enter the code into the state roborock.<instance>.loginCode within 15 minutes of starting the adapter.": "选择“Email + 2FA Code”时，Roborock 会通过邮件发送六位验证码。此处没有输入框：请在适配器启动后 15 分钟内将验证码写入状态 roborock.<instance>.loginCode。",
  "Connection mode": "连接模式",
  "Cloud and local": "云端与本地",
  "Local only (no cloud contact)": "仅本地（不连接云端）",
  "Local only: the adapter never contacts the Roborock cloud. This requires manually configured devices with duid and localKey. Cloud based functions stay unavailable in this mode - map retrieval currently needs the cloud connection, as do saved scenes, firmware information and camera streaming. There is no automatic fallback to the cloud.": "仅本地：适配器绝不连接 Roborock 云端。这需要手动配置带有 duid 和 localKey 的设备。此模式下云端功能不可用——地图获取目前需要云端连接，已保存的场景、固件信息和摄像头串流同样如此。不会自动回退到云端。",
  "Manual devices (JSON)": "手动设备（JSON）",
  "JSON array, one object per device: {\"duid\": \"...\", \"localKey\": \"...\", \"ip\": \"192.168.1.50\", \"pv\": \"1.0\"}. Optional: name, model, category, sn. The localKey is a 16 character device secret that only exists in the Roborock cloud device list and cannot be derived locally; it changes only when the device is paired again. Log in once with your account to read it, then keep it here. It is stored encrypted and never written to the log.": "JSON 数组，每台设备一个对象：{\"duid\": \"...\", \"localKey\": \"...\", \"ip\": \"192.168.1.50\", \"pv\": \"1.0\"}。可选：name、model、category、sn。localKey 是 16 个字符的设备密钥，仅存在于 Roborock 云端设备列表中，无法在本地推导；只有重新配对时才会改变。请用账户登录一次以读取该密钥，然后保存在此处。它以加密方式存储，绝不会写入日志。",
  "Search devices in network": "搜索网络中的设备",
  "Listens for device broadcasts and reports duid, IP address and protocol version, so a manual entry can be created without a cloud account. The adapter instance must be running.": "监听设备广播并报告 duid、IP 地址和协议版本，以便在没有云端账户的情况下创建手动条目。适配器实例必须处于运行状态。",
  "Listen for device broadcasts (UDP 58866)": "监听设备广播（UDP 58866）",
  "Off: only devices with a statically configured IP address are used. Helpful when broadcasts are filtered (VLAN, WLAN client isolation, LXC or Docker bridges).": "关闭：仅使用配置了静态 IP 地址的设备。当广播被过滤时（VLAN、无线客户端隔离、LXC 或 Docker 网桥）很有用。",
  "Network interface for discovery": "用于设备发现的网络接口",
  "IP address of the interface the UDP discovery socket binds to. Empty means all interfaces, which can fail on hosts with several networks.": "UDP 发现套接字绑定的接口 IP 地址。留空表示所有接口，在拥有多个网络的主机上可能失败。",
  "JSON array of { duid, localKey, ip, pv }. The localKey is a device secret and is stored encrypted.": "由 { duid, localKey, ip, pv } 组成的 JSON 数组。localKey 是设备密钥，以加密方式存储。",
